        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Datquinso Desktop Pets!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These pets are cute, expressive, and most importantly, low-profile.<br>They’re designed to keep you company without getting in your way — whether you're working, gaming, streaming, or just chilling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don’t interact with them, they’ll simply hang out on your screen until someone (or something!) wakes them up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐾 Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎨 Customize</strong><br>Choose from a variety of fur styles, faces, and clothing options to make each pet unique and stylish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎮 Play</strong><br>Pets will bounce around, chase toys, stack on top of each other, and even grab your mouse (if you let them). You can also give them head pats :3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💬 <strong>Stream</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pets aren’t just cute — they love your community! Watch them react in real-time to Twitch chat messages and commands.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>😴 Sleep</strong><br>When you’re away, your pets will cling to nearby windows or the taskbar and take naps. Give them a little shake or a gentle pat to wake them up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🤝 Share</strong><br>Send your favorite pets to friends using the built-in friends menu. Just exchange friend codes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📬 Visit</strong><br>Pets marked as friends will occasionally visit your desktop, joining your main pet for a surprise appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌿 Care</strong><br>Your pets gently remind you to drink water, take breaks, and offer a few kind words to keep your spirits up during long sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔒 Privacy</strong><br>This app stays offline unless you choose to connect to Twitch and does not collect ANY data from your system. It’s fully offline by design — even friend codes work without a connection. No guessing, no tracking, just pets.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Datquinso Desktop Pets!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These pets are cute, expressive, and most importantly, low-profile.<br>They’re designed to keep you company without getting in your way — whether you're working, gaming, streaming, or just chilling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don’t interact with them, they’ll simply hang out on your screen until someone (or something!) wakes them up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐾 Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎨 Customize</strong><br>Choose from a variety of fur styles, faces, and clothing options to make each pet unique and stylish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎮 Play</strong><br>Pets will bounce around, chase toys, stack on top of each other, and even grab your mouse (if you let them). You can also give them head pats :3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💬 <strong>Stream</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pets aren’t just cute — they love your community! Watch them react in real-time to Twitch chat messages and commands.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>😴 Sleep</strong><br>When you’re away, your pets will cling to nearby windows or the taskbar and take naps. Give them a little shake or a gentle pat to wake them up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🤝 Share</strong><br>Send your favorite pets to friends using the built-in friends menu. Just exchange friend codes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📬 Visit</strong><br>Pets marked as friends will occasionally visit your desktop, joining your main pet for a surprise appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌿 Care</strong><br>Your pets gently remind you to drink water, take breaks, and offer a few kind words to keep your spirits up during long sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔒 Privacy</strong><br>This app stays offline unless you choose to connect to Twitch and does not collect ANY data from your system. It’s fully offline by design — even friend codes work without a connection. No guessing, no tracking, just pets.</p>",
        "short_description": "Your screen just got a little cozier — meet your new digital companions.",
